他乃是一军主帅，带领着手下将领兄弟出生入死，每每打胜仗之后，便一起在一处湖水中沐浴打闹，赤身相见，有何奇怪。不过，眼前的这位喜好着实特别的摄政王，却与其他男子不同，看到他的身体，反倒是用异样的眼光打量着他，别有深意，想起如今还被他强行扣押与摄政王府的弟弟，慕寒遥心中对凤傲天的冷意更多了几分。凤傲天眉眼淡淡，眸子里幽深似谷，璨然一笑令日月容光失色，薄唇轻启，修长如玉的手指毫无预兆地扯下慕寒遥束发的发带，“这就当作是你适才冒犯本王的赔罪之礼吧。”语调冷漠，手指勾着如棉布质感的发带，淡漠如常，负手而立，身姿笔挺，比慕寒遥这般常年操兵训练的将军还更有将帅之风，透着冷厉气势，再配上那与生俱来的俾睨天下的王者霸气，任谁见到都不敢直视，心生恐惧。相反，此时被突然偷袭的慕寒遥，忿然转身，与她对视，如墨的长发披散与胸前，垂落与胸前的青丝，随着他精壮的身躯，此起彼伏的胸口，随风吹拂。腰腹间印刻着代表着他无上荣光的刀疤伤痕，一手紧握佩刀，另一只手背与身后，端得是气势磅礴，并无丝毫的惧怕与尴尬之色，反倒是那一双深邃的眸光中，溢满了一望无际的寒冷。“慕寒遥，如今长夜漫漫，难道你想如此与本王共度？”凤傲天径自从他身旁越过，端坐于主帅之位，居高临下，话语间竟是轻佻之意，但，跪与一处的将领却听出了嗜血凶残的杀意。慕寒遥冷然转眸，冷眸锐利地直视着凤傲天，“若摄政王当真有如此雅兴，草民自然不敢抗命。”玑柏心下大骇，慕将军这是要做什么？难道要委身于摄政王吗？不，万万不可，若当真如此的话，那么，与他出生入死的这些将领还有何希望与指望？李肃听闻，抬眸，看了一眼慕寒遥，大惊道，“将军，万万不能啊。”慕寒遥刚毅的容颜，漆黑的瞳眸，凝聚着寒光，并未看李肃一眼，不过是看到他身旁的佩刀，还有这一众跪在地上的将领，他亦是能猜出十之八九。凤傲天并不是一时兴起，亦或是对他真的有兴趣，才将他自采石场掳回来，若是，便不会当着忠于他的下属的面对他如此的羞辱。回想起刚才他被解开穴道的瞬间，并无他想，拔刀向凤傲天刺去，而他依旧是那般的气定神闲，仿佛一早便洞悉出他会有如此的举动。如今，他必须冷静下来，切不可再过与冲动，他忍了这么多年，差点因怒意冲昏头脑，险些酿成大错，但，心中却对这传闻中残暴不仁的摄政王有了不同的认识。或许他并不像谣传中那般的喜怒无常，昏庸无道。“草民在摄政王眼中不过是一名囚犯，况且，君让臣死臣不得不死。”慕寒遥不卑不亢，铿锵有力地应道，眸底溢满的坚定气魄，此刻的他犹如一块巨石，屹立不倒。凤傲天眸光微眯，一道寒光射出，直袭向岿然不动，立于她眼前的慕寒遥，“本王的确厌烦了那些娇柔做作之态的男子，如今，更喜你这般凶猛的狮子，你甚合本王口味。”此言一出，跪与地上的众人顿时吓出一身冷汗，遂将目光落在慕寒遥身上。慕寒遥冷着一张脸，心中冷笑，难道是他判断错误？他的残暴人尽皆知，又怎会突然转性，他倒要看看这摄政王到底有何目的，难不成当真要对他动手？若是如此，他亦不会再强忍下去，命可无，傲骨不可无，他慕寒遥，乃顶天立地男子汉，怎会委身于一名男子，成为人人唾弃的娈人？若真如此的话，那么，结果便是一个，不是他死便是我亡。“今夜天色极好，不知本王的宝贝们如今可寻到食物？”凤傲天手指勾起发带，注视着良久，“李校尉，如今这个时候，正是大开城门放栖国士兵入城的好时机不是吗？”李肃连忙收敛激动，跪与地上，“恳请摄政王赐末将死罪。”如今，他再无任何活着的念头，若是慕将军也被这摄政王染指了，那他还如何立足与世？苟且偷生，倒不如现在一死百了，眼不见为净。凤傲天心中嗤笑，这李肃如今除了这句话，便无其他请求，看来这些年来，军营的训练的确松懈了不少，难怪栖国会如此张狂，“慕寒遥，这便是你手下的将领？口口声声喊着‘凤国亡矣’叫嚣之言，却如此胆小怯懦，不敢承担的废物，竟然能做阵前先锋，本王还真是见识了慕家军的风采。”慕寒遥眸光一沉，转眸，看了一眼垂首跪与地上一脸赴死的李肃，一一扫过跪与营帐内的将领，曾几何时，他们一同誓死相随，出生入死，经历过无数险境，可是，如今……却个个面带愁容，他单膝跪与地上，“摄政王，慕家军永不言败。”“永不言败？”凤傲天扬声嗤笑，笑容刺穿营帐，传至天际，夜空中回荡着她狂傲嘲讽的笑声。玑柏想起李肃所言，抬眸看了一眼慕寒遥，他自惭形秽，后悔当时为何任由着李肃讲出那些昏话，如今，覆水难收，是他们自己在引以为傲的慕家军脸上，重重地狠狠地打了一记响亮的巴掌。李肃再傻也明白摄政王话中的讥讽，不战而败，慕家军即便拼到一兵一卒，也没有退缩的道理，他如今追悔莫及，话已说出，覆水难收。凤傲天轻蔑地看向慕寒遥，将早先李肃所言一五一十地说出，直到话落，四周寂静无声。“慕家军也不过如此。”这一声轻蔑之语，若是旁人说出，并无多大反应，但，自残暴淫虐的摄政王口中说出，如同是将他们心中的大山瞬间推倒。慕寒遥心神一震，抬眸，似是看到他引以为傲的神柱瞬间坍塌，连带着他坚毅的心也随之塌陷。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－亲耐哒们，嘿嘿……喜欢的话记得收藏哦！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/yetaicanbao/8.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Volume 1 Regency Storm 008 You are very much in line with my wishes. \"Isn't this the regent's hobby?\" Mu Hanyao's eyes flashed with a cold light, completely ignoring the position he was in now. So what if he was naked? So what if you are admired openly by others? How little has he experienced? Once upon a time, he was the commander-in-chief of an army, leading his generals and brothers through life and death. After winning a battle, they would bathe and play in a lake together, seeing each other naked, how strange it was. However, the regent in front of him, who had really special preferences, was different from other men. When he saw his body, he looked at him with a strange look, with deep meaning. Thinking of his younger brother who was still being forcibly detained by him in the regent's palace, Mu Hanyao felt a little more cold towards Feng Aotian. Feng Aotian's eyebrows were light, and his eyes were as deep as valleys. He smiled brightly, making the sun and the moon eclipse his face. His thin lips parted slightly, and his slender jade-like fingers pulled off the hair tie that bound Mu Hanyao's hair without any warning. \"Consider this a gift of apology for offending me just now.\" His tone was cold, and his fingers were like hooks. The cotton-textured hairband was indifferent as usual. He stood with his hands behind his back and his posture was upright. He looked more like a general than Mu Hanyao, a general who has been training all year round. He exuded a cold and stern aura, coupled with the innate domineering aura of a king who looked down on the world. No one dared to look directly at him and felt fear in his heart. On the contrary, Mu Hanyao, who was suddenly attacked at this time, turned around angrily and looked at her. His long black hair was spread on his chest, and the black hair hanging down on his chest was blown by the wind along with his strong body and chest. There are scars on his waist and abdomen that represent his supreme glory. He holds the sword tightly in one hand and holds the other hand behind his back with a majestic look. There is no trace of fear or embarrassment. On the contrary, his pair of deep eyes are filled with boundless coldness. \"Mu Hanyao, it's a long night now, do you want to spend this time with me like this?\" Feng Aotian walked past him and sat in the position of the commander, condescending. His words were frivolous, but the general kneeling beside him could hear the bloodthirsty and murderous intention. Mu Hanyao turned his eyes coldly, and looked directly at Feng Aotian with cold eyes, \"If the regent is really so elegant, the common people will naturally not dare to disobey.\" Ji Bai was horrified, what is General Mu going to do? Do you want to commit yourself to the regent? No, absolutely not. If this is really the case, then what hope and hope do these generals who have been with him through life and death have? After hearing this, Li Su raised his eyes, glanced at Mu Hanyao, and said in shock, \"General, you can't do this.\" Mu Hanyao's resolute face and dark pupils were condensed with cold light. He didn't even look at Li Su. He just saw the saber beside him and the generals kneeling on the ground. He could probably guess it. Feng Aotian didn't kidnap him back from the quarry on a whim, or because he was really interested in him. If so, he wouldn't have faced such humiliation in front of his subordinates who were loyal to him. Recalling the moment when his acupuncture points were unlocked, he drew his sword and stabbed Feng Aotian without thinking, but he was still so calm and composed, as if he had known that he would do such a thing early on. Now, he must calm down and stop being impulsive. After enduring it for so many years, he almost got carried away with anger and almost made a big mistake. However, in his heart, he had a different understanding of the rumored cruel and cruel regent. Perhaps he is not as moody and ignorant as the rumors say. \"The common people are just prisoners in the eyes of the regent. Besides, if you let your subjects die, they will have to die.\" Mu Hanyao responded sonorously and forcefully, neither humble nor arrogant. His eyes were full of determination. At this moment, he was like a huge stone, standing tall and unyielding. Feng Aotian's eyes narrowed slightly, and a cold light shot out, hitting Mu Hanyao who was standing unmoving in front of her, \"I am really tired of those delicate and artificial men. Now, I prefer a fierce lion like you. You are very suitable for me.\" As soon as these words came out, everyone kneeling on the ground suddenly broke out in a cold sweat, and then their eyes fell on Mu Hanyao. Mu Hanyao had a cold face and sneered in his heart. Could it be that he made a mistake in judgment? Everyone knows his cruelty, so how could he suddenly change his nature? He wants to see what the regent's purpose is. Is it possible that he really wants to take action against him? If this is the case, he will not endure it any longer. His life is at stake, but his pride is indispensable. He admires Hanyao and is an indomitable man. How could he commit himself to a man and become a rapist that everyone despises? If this is the case, then the result is one, either he dies or I die. \"The sky is very beautiful tonight. I wonder if my darlings can find food now?\" Feng Aotian raised his hairband with his fingers and stared at it for a long time, \"Liu Lieutenant, now is a good time to open the city gates and let the soldiers of the Qi Kingdom enter the city. Isn't it?\" Li Su quickly calmed down his excitement and knelt on the ground, \"I beg the regent to give this general the death penalty.\" Now, he no longer has any thoughts of living. If General Mu is also involved by this regent, how can he survive in the world? It would be better to live an ignoble existence than to be dead now, out of sight. Feng Aotian sneered in his heart. Li Su had no other request except these words. It seems that the training in the military camp has indeed slackened a lot over the years. No wonder Qiguo State is so arrogant, \"Mu Hanyao, is this your general? He keeps shouting \"Feng Kingdom is dead\", but he is such a timid and cowardly waste who dare not take the responsibility. He can actually be the vanguard of the formation. This king has really seen the Mu family. The demeanor of an army.\" Mu Hanyao's eyes darkened, and he glanced at Li Su, who was kneeling on the ground with a look of death, and glanced at the generals who were kneeling in the camp. Once upon a time, they fought together to the death, and experienced countless dangers. However, now... they all looked sad, and he knelt on one knee, \"Prince Regent, the Mu family army will never say defeat?\" \"Never say defeat?\" Feng Aotian said.", "title_en": "Chapter 8"}